<title>GERMANY: Condor denies buying 12 Airbus A320s.</title>
<headline>Condor denies buying 12 Airbus A320s.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A spokeswoman for German charter airline Condor on Tuesday denied reports that the airline had bought 12 Airbus A320 aircraft.</p>
<p>Airbus had said in a statement received in Singapore earlier on Tuesday that Condor would purchase 12 of the aircraft with an option for another 12.</p>
<p>&quot;We have not ordered any Airbuses,&quot; the spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
